    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3738660/extras/c1aabd3231ff849f917fc998ba023328.poster.avif?t=1753983240\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3738660/extras/c1aabd3231ff849f917fc998ba023328.webm?t=1753983240\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3738660/extras/c1aabd3231ff849f917fc998ba023328.mp4?t=1753983240\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3738660/extras/bf0d0cc2b599256bcfab376c41582b60.poster.avif?t=1753983240\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3738660/extras/bf0d0cc2b599256bcfab376c41582b60.webm?t=1753983240\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3738660/extras/bf0d0cc2b599256bcfab376c41582b60.mp4?t=1753983240\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3738660/extras/4c94434a3cc2e17870304e6bcafc3892.poster.avif?t=1753983240\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3738660/extras/4c94434a3cc2e17870304e6bcafc3892.webm?t=1753983240\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3738660/extras/4c94434a3cc2e17870304e6bcafc3892.mp4?t=1753983240\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight monsters in each night, survive as long as you can! Nocturnal Survivors is a single player survivor-like auto-shooter game in which you simply keep combining your weapons to more powerful versions to kill thousands of monsters at nights.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gameplay features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Infinite map with day-night cycles (currently 3 maps with 5 types of monster in each map in Early Access)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deep weapon combination system (currently 40 weapons in Early Access)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bizarre and powerful artifacts (currently 40 artifacts in Early Access)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More roguelike experience from random interactable objects and elite monsters</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Update v0.4 will be available on Aug 1. Please check update details in events and announcements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3738660/extras/263237de50c749b83f2f03aa0b9ff593.avif?t=1753983240\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3738660/extras/c1aabd3231ff849f917fc998ba023328.poster.avif?t=1753983240\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3738660/extras/c1aabd3231ff849f917fc998ba023328.webm?t=1753983240\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3738660/extras/c1aabd3231ff849f917fc998ba023328.mp4?t=1753983240\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3738660/extras/bf0d0cc2b599256bcfab376c41582b60.poster.avif?t=1753983240\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3738660/extras/bf0d0cc2b599256bcfab376c41582b60.webm?t=1753983240\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3738660/extras/bf0d0cc2b599256bcfab376c41582b60.mp4?t=1753983240\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3738660/extras/4c94434a3cc2e17870304e6bcafc3892.poster.avif?t=1753983240\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3738660/extras/4c94434a3cc2e17870304e6bcafc3892.webm?t=1753983240\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3738660/extras/4c94434a3cc2e17870304e6bcafc3892.mp4?t=1753983240\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight monsters in each night, survive as long as you can! Nocturnal Survivors is a single player survivor-like auto-shooter game in which you simply keep combining your weapons to more powerful versions to kill thousands of monsters at nights.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gameplay features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Infinite map with day-night cycles (currently 3 maps with 5 types of monster in each map in Early Access)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deep weapon combination system (currently 40 weapons in Early Access)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bizarre and powerful artifacts (currently 40 artifacts in Early Access)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More roguelike experience from random interactable objects and elite monsters</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Update v0.4 will be available on Aug 1. Please check update details in events and announcements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3738660/extras/263237de50c749b83f2f03aa0b9ff593.avif?t=1753983240\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p>",
